  "title": "Ahsoka Tano",
  "description": "Ahsoka Tano was brought into the Jedi Order by Master Pio Koon. She was assigned to Anakin Skywalker as a Padawan early on in the Clone Wars, and served as his apprentice until nearly the end of the war, when she left the Jedi Order after being accused of a crime she didn't commit. She spent much of the dark times of the Empire aiding the Alliance to Restore the Republic. For a time, she acted as the spymaster Fulcrum, until she faced her former master-turned-Sith Lord on the planet Malachor, where she was stranded until she found her way back."
